1
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:31,000
Strangers is a action, thriller, crime film directed by Tony Dean Smith.

2
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:56,000
Seeking revenge on her abusive husband, a woman's life takes a
dark turn when she meets a mysterious hitman.

3
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:21,000
Drawn into a whirlwind romance, she spirals into a dangerous vigilante spree.

4
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:46,000
As the body count rises, she begins to unravel the true nature of
her partner and the secrets they both conceal.

5
00:22:05,000 --> 00:22:11,000
Laura, played by Sienna Guillory.

6
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:36,000
Richard, played by Jon Voight.

7
00:30:55,000 --> 00:31:01,000
Sky, played by Jamie Bamber.

8
00:35:20,000 --> 00:35:26,000
Tony, played by Emmett Scanlan.

9
00:39:45,000 --> 00:39:51,000
Kirk, played by Alex Blake.

10
00:44:10,000 --> 00:44:16,000
Priest, played by Euan Macnaughton.

11
00:48:35,000 --> 00:48:41,000
The Strangers: Chapter 1 is a 2024 American horror film.

12
00:53:00,000 --> 00:53:06,000
It is the third film in The Strangers film series and the first installment
of an intended relaunch in the form of a standalone trilogy.

13
00:57:25,000 --> 00:57:31,000
It was directed by Renny Harlin, with a screenplay by Alan R.

14
01:01:50,000 --> 01:01:56,000
Cohen and Alan Freedland, from a story by Bryan Bertino, the
writer and director of the original film.

15
01:06:15,000 --> 01:06:21,000
The film stars Madelaine Petsch, Froy Gutierrez and Ema Horvath, and follows a couple who come
into contact with three psychopathic masked strangers while on a road trip.

16
01:10:40,000 --> 01:10:46,000
Plans for a consecutively shot trilogy of Strangers films were announced
in August 2022 by the original film's producer, Roy Lee.

17
01:15:05,000 --> 01:15:11,000
Harlin was announced as the director of all three the following
month, with most of the cast joining soon after.

18
01:19:30,000 --> 01:19:36,000
Production on the films took place in Bratislava between September and November that year,
often alternating daily between which of the three Chapters was being shot.

19
01:23:55,000 --> 01:24:01,000
The Strangers: Chapter 1 had its world premiere at Regal L.A.

20
01:28:20,000 --> 01:28:26,000
Live on May 8, 2024, and was released theatrically in the
United States by Lionsgate Films on May 17, 2024.

21
01:32:45,000 --> 01:32:51,000
The film received generally negative reviews from critics
and grossed over $48.2 million worldwide.

22
01:37:10,000 --> 01:37:16,000
The film's sequel, The Strangers – Chapter 2, was released on September 26,
2025, and Chapter 3 is expected to be released on February 6, 2026.

23
01:41:35,000 --> 01:41:41,000
The tone is dark and intense.
